# ---- BMad: share team config + planning outputs, keep installs per-machine ----
# Installer-managed files: each teammate runs the BMad installer locally.
/_bmad/*
# Team overrides (committed, everyone inherits on pull).
!/_bmad/custom/
# Personal overrides and install answers (never committed).
*.user.toml
# _bmad-output/ (research, spec, architecture, stories) and its .memlog.md files
# are committed: the memlog is what BMad skills resume from when a teammate
# updates an artifact.
